  "description": "I was playing alone at home. Then a man appeared and said I was a princess.\n\nEven though you say you don't like it, they're dragging you along, right?\n\nWhen I came to my senses, it was already a different world. I asked him what he was doing and he comforted me by saving the world. Ah, what on earth do I want from an adolescent high school girl who has not yet been able to save my life, let alone the world?\n\nOne girl tells you how to save the world.  \nA story where anyone can save the world, an ordinary but not easy story.\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://www.comico.jp/comic/8759)",
